    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/clothing/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "Clothing is a responsive and feature-rich WordPress theme developed by WpDevArt. The theme supports WooCommerce and works perfectly with this popular e-commerce plugin. It is fully integrated with WooCommerce so you can create beautiful stores using this theme. The WordPress Clothing theme has many useful features to create a beautiful blog or online clothing store. One of the theme's greatest strengths is its clear and attractive design. Another advantage of the theme is the various layouts. This means you can change the default settings and set different designs for posts, pages, and even Woo pages. WordPress Clothing theme allows you to create your own design without any coding knowledge. You can change all design elements directly from the admin panel on the Customizer page. Another benefit of the theme is its powerful and well-designed custom homepage. You can enable/disable various must-have sections on your custom homepage and make it very attractive to your users. The banner section on the homepage has various options such as intro texts, sliding texts, buttons, animated images, etc. You can change all the settings of these elements or hide the ones you don't need. Another advantage of our theme is the ability to change the website font. You can choose the font you need from 10 popular fonts (40 additional fonts are available in the premium version). The Clothing theme also allows you to set gradient colors for posts, pages, archives, and other banners. Banner elements are also customizable. You can change the color of the title and metadata, and set the position of the elements. Additionally, the Clothing has a premium version that offers even more features. For example, in the premium version, you can set animations for different elements of the header and banner, add additional homepage sections, choose other popular fonts, etc."
    },
